---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { APP_URL } from "../site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About · Orbit"
  description="Orbit Bot is an Orbit product powered by Forion for autonomous agents with persistent computers and real tools."
>
  <div class="container">
    <Header />
    <main id="main" class="privacy-copy">
      <h1>About Orbit</h1>
      <p>
        Orbit Bot is an Orbit product built by Forion for autonomous agents that can do practical work. Each bot gets a
        persistent computer with a browser, shell, files, and a desktop, plus the tools it needs to finish a job.
      </p>
      <h2>Built for work you can follow</h2>
      <p>
        Agents should be understandable and controllable. Orbit keeps routines readable, records activity,
        pauses for approval before consequential actions, and lets you take over a computer when a task needs
        you. You choose the model behind each bot.
      </p>
      <h2>One workspace, every screen</h2>
      <p>
        The same bots and workspaces are available on the web, in the desktop app, and on mobile. Start a task
        in one place and check on it from another.
      </p>
      <p>
        For product or account help, email <a href="mailto:hello@forion.dev">hello@forion.dev</a> or
        <a href={APP_URL}>open Orbit</a>.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
